no individual or group is solely responsible for representing the community’s 
perspective. 
o Understand and address language barriers. This can be done by offering all 
communications in accessible, digestible language free from technical jargon and 
in multiple languages depending on the community demographics. Dedicate 
budget resources to interpretation and translation services.19 
o Offer multiple modes and opportunities for the community to engage and 
