decisions are consistent with statutory requirements and relevant Executive Orders, and where 
they should be applied.
In conclusion, the Big Pine Paiute Tribe of the Owens Valley appreciates the opportunity to 
submit this comment and looks forward to further work with EPA on this important issue. The 
Tribe may want to ask for consultation on the framework if appropriate If you have any 
questions or require clarification, please do not hesitate to contact Cindy Duriscoe, Air 
Program Coordinator at c.duriscoe@bigpinepaiute.org.
