supra note 32, at 3. Some residents of St. James Parish live on land purchased by their ancestors, some of whom 
were enslaved at nearby plantations. See HUM. RTS. WATCH, supra note 3, at 51, 94. 
36 See HUM. RTS. WATCH, supra note 3, at 30. 
37 Following the Civil War, St. James Parish and Louisiana experienced frequent violence by white citizens. 
